// `==` on a POLYMORPHIC sum compares its payload by ADDRESS. Measured
// 2026-09-18 while classifying a proposal tie: two structurally equal
// `Some(LI(7))` answered unequal, and the emitted helper says why —
// `$eq_nOption`, ONE helper for every instantiation, loading `Some`'s
// payload at offset 4 and comparing it with `(i32.eq)`.
//
// The root is two reads that drop a proof the graph holds. `fold_sig`
// renders `TName(n, args)` as the bare name, so `Option(Boxed)` and
// `Option(Int)` share one helper where `TList` / `TTuple` / `TRecord` all
// fold their payloads structurally; and `variant_specs_of` answers with the
// constructor's DECLARED payload types, so `Some`'s is the quantified var,
// which `emit_field_eq`'s final arm turns into a word compare with no
// diagnostic — the silent surrender-fallback at the one site
// `T_EqTypeUnprovable` does not visit, because the unprovable operand is
// inside a generated leaf rather than at an authored comparison.
//
// The monomorphic control passes on the same run: `LI(7) == LI(7)` is 0,
// because there every declared payload is ground.
//
// DECLARED RED (`Hβ.eq.polymorphic-sum-payload-is-pointer-eq`). It turns
// green by PROOF — the sig folding its arguments and the specs substituting
// them — never by a comparator written beside it.
// expect: 0

type Boxed = BInt(Int) | BText(String)

fn main() = {
  let control = if BInt(7) == BInt(7) { 0 } else { 1 }
  let wrapped = if Some(BInt(7)) == Some(BInt(7)) { 0 } else { 2 }
  let text = if Some(BText("ab")) == Some(BText(str_concat("a", "b"))) { 0 } else { 4 }
  control + wrapped + text
}
